<%- include('partials/header', { title: `Report · ${campaign.name}`, error: null }) %><div class="report-header"><div><p class="eyebrow">Security awareness report</p><h1><%= campaign.name %></h1><p class="muted">Audience: <%= campaign.audience_label %> · Generated <%= campaign.created_at %></p></div><div class="no-print"><a class="button secondary" href="/campaigns/<%= campaign.id %>">← Back</a><button class="button primary" onclick="window.print()">Print / save PDF</button></div></div><div class="report-summary"><div><span>Unique clicks</span><strong><%= metrics.clicks %></strong></div><div><span>Dummy submissions</span><strong><%= metrics.submissions %></strong></div><div><span>Awareness rate</span><strong><%= metrics.awareness %>%</strong></div></div><section class="panel"><h2>Outcome detail</h2><p class="muted">Risk is a transparent training heuristic: click = 40 points, dummy submission = 60 points. No credential content contributes to this score.</p><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Participant</th><th>Clicks</th><th>Submissions</th><th>Score</th><th>Level</th></tr></thead><tbody><% participants.forEach((p) => { %><tr><td><%= p.participant_code %></td><td><%= p.clicks %></td><td><%= p.submissions %></td><td><%= p.risk_score %>/100</td><td><span class="risk <%= p.risk_label.toLowerCase() %>"><%= p.risk_label %></span></td></tr><% }) %></tbody></table></div></section><section class="panel"><h2>Recommended follow-up</h2><p>Discuss how to verify links through a known channel, recognize urgency cues, and report suspicious messages. Keep this report anonymized and use it for learning—not punishment.</p></section><%- include('partials/footer') %>
